<LanguageData>

  <!-- EN: ate cooked fleshberries -->
  <FH_AteCookedFleshberry.stages.ate_cooked_fleshberries.label>吃了烹飪過的肉果</FH_AteCookedFleshberry.stages.ate_cooked_fleshberries.label>
  <!-- EN: The fleshberries were cooked, but the meal still carried a faint fleshy aftertaste. -->
  <FH_AteCookedFleshberry.stages.ate_cooked_fleshberries.description>肉果已經烹飪過了，但這頓飯裡仍然殘留著一絲肉質回味。</FH_AteCookedFleshberry.stages.ate_cooked_fleshberries.description>

  <!-- EN: ate raw fleshberries -->
  <FH_AteRawFleshberry.stages.ate_raw_fleshberries.label>生吃肉果</FH_AteRawFleshberry.stages.ate_raw_fleshberries.label>
  <!-- EN: The fleshberries were sweet, but eating them raw left a disturbing taste of living meat. -->
  <FH_AteRawFleshberry.stages.ate_raw_fleshberries.description>肉果確實帶著甜味，但生吃後留下了一股令人不安的活肉味。</FH_AteRawFleshberry.stages.ate_raw_fleshberries.description>

  <!-- EN: flesh nutrition -->
  <FH_Thought_FleshNutrition.stages.flesh_nutrition.label>血肉營養</FH_Thought_FleshNutrition.stages.flesh_nutrition.label>
  <!-- EN: I drew nutrition directly from the flesh hive. It did not feel good. -->
  <FH_Thought_FleshNutrition.stages.flesh_nutrition.description>我直接從血肉巢群中獲取了營養，這感覺不太好。</FH_Thought_FleshNutrition.stages.flesh_nutrition.description>

